title: Denial Intelligence › Peer-to-peer › Book the call
route: /denials?id=D-3318
intro: The confirm gate for the peer-to-peer route: pick one of three call windows, confirm, and Cadence books it. The same modal opens from the options card, from 'Change the time' and from the brief page.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the three times are counted from the demo's first day (Tue 10/20), not from the demo clock, so after a fast-forward they can already be in the past. The payer holding the slot is simulated.
---
start s1 "Click 'Choose a time and prepare the brief' (Your options)"
start s2 "Click 'Change the time' (call-booked banner)"
start s3 "Brief page: click 'Book the call' or 'Change the call time'"

overlay o1 "Modal 'Confirm the next step: peer-to-peer call'\n'The agents stop here until you say go.'"
screen l1 "'What happens when you confirm'\nCadence books the window with the payer and adds it to the clinician's calendar\nAdvocate finishes the brief with three points and the likely pushback\nIntegrity checks every sentence against the chart"
screen l2 "'Pick a time. Chance of overturning is 64% (likely 55–72%).'"
process p1 "Up to three windows on the next working days: 9–11 am, 1–3 pm, 4–5 pm\nOnly times before the payer's window closes"
decision d1 "Is any call time left?"
toast t1 "'No call time is left inside the payer's window. Choose a written appeal instead.'\n'Confirm and book the call' is greyed out"
input i1 "Pick a call time (radio cards)\nFirst is chosen, or the one already booked"
process p2 "Card text: 'Booked now' on the booked time, 'Open with the payer's reviewer' on the others"

click c1 "Click 'Confirm and book the call'"
click c2 "Click 'Cancel', the X, press Esc, or click the dimmed area"
endx e1 "Nothing changes"

store st1 "Call time saved on the denial\nChip 'Call booked', list pill 'Call Wed 10/21 1 pm'"
ext x1 "Payer's reviewer holds the window (demo: simulated)"
agent a1 "Cadence books the window and adds it to the clinician's calendar"
agent a2 "Advocate writes the brief, Integrity checks it against the chart"
store st2 "History: 'Cadence booked the peer-to-peer call for ...', 'Advocate wrote the brief and Integrity checked it against the chart', and a scheduled 'Peer-to-peer call with Cardinal'"
toast t2 "'Call booked'\n'Wed 10/21, 1–3 pm. The brief is ready.'"
decision d2 "Booked from which page?"
process p3 "Modal closes and the app opens the brief page"
process p4 "Modal closes, the brief stays open\n'Call details' shows the new window"
goto g1 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Peer-to-peer › The brief"
end e2 "Call is booked, brief is ready"

s1 --> o1
s2 --> o1
s3 --> o1
o1 --> l1 --> l2 --> p1 --> d1
d1 -->|No| t1 --> c2
d1 -->|Yes| i1 --> p2
p2 --> c1
p2 --> c2 --> e1
c1 --> st1 --> x1 --> a1 --> a2 --> st2 --> t2 --> d2
d2 -->|Denial page| p3 --> g1
d2 -->|Brief page| p4 --> e2
